# Deploy On Request Only

**Do not** run `npm run deploy:coolify` after routine code changes.

**Deploy** only when the user clearly asks to deploy (e.g. "deploy", "push to Coolify", "ship this", "deploy to prod").

When they ask, run:
```
npm run deploy:coolify
```

If unsure whether they want a deploy, ask once or wait for explicit instruction.
